      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The smoldering leopard makes two claw Strikes against a creature it has Grabbed. A creature hit by both claw Strikes also takes 1d4 Persistent,fire Damage damage. Both attacks count toward its multiple attack penalty, but the penalty increases only after both attacks are made.</p>",
